    "construction": "Bivariate bicycle code over F_2[x,y]/(x^5-1, y^9-1), weight-5 mixed-monomial polynomials A = 1 + x^2 y^8 + x^3 y^7, B = 1 + x^2 y^6, found by an LLM-guided evolutionary search (OpenEvolve, weight-5 mixed-monomial campaign) over CSS BB polynomial pairs. This connected (ell=5, m=9) presentation is BLISS-isomorphic to one of 2 identical connected components of a disconnected parent BB code (ell=10, m=9, k=8, n=180, A = 1 + x^4 y^8 + x^6 y^7, B = 1 + x^4 y^6) whose exact distance d=9 was established by MILP in the source repository; the component presentation used here was independently re-verified exact (d_X=d_Z=9, no lighter logical on either side) with this repository's own verify/certify.py (scipy/HiGHS MILP, tlim=600s, 70s wall time).",
